    "sentence_translations": [
      "Having A Mistress?",
      "",
      "One day, Little Ming's mom made him call his dad on the phone, to tell him to come home for dinner.",
      "After the five years old Little Ming had finished the call, he said: \"Mom, dad didn't answer. It was a lady who answered.\"",
      "",
      "An hour later, the dad returned.",
      "Mom didn't let him come into the house, but made him stand outside the door for two hours.",
      "",
      "After two hours, mom said: \"Little ming, tell dad why I won't let him come in.\"",
      "",
      "Little Ming: \"Because it was a lady who answered the phone call to daddy today.\"",
      "",
      "Dad: \"Little Ming, what did the lady actually say?\"",
      "",
      "Little Ming: \"The lady said, the number you have dialed is currently busy.\"",
      "",
      "Mom did not say anything.",
      "When the mom first heard Little Ming say that a lady had answered, she believed the father had a mistress.",
      "She never expected that this was the phrase which that \"lady\" had said."
    ]
  }
